      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T14:26:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mainly getting the API right if I\u0027m going to touch it. The two additional pieces are:\n\n1. Adding the data type parameter for non-byte yuv formats.\n\n2. More structured results, as pixmaps. The reason the original API produced more raw results was the insufficiency of SkColorType at the time for a range of YUV formats. SkColorType has since expanded and SkYUVAPixmaps now exists for exactly this use case: holding a set of pixmaps that make up a YUVA image.",
      "parentUuid": "f8799c9e_9084b04f",
      "revId": "3aa840fd0848f59aa42af4e4f9f8028fd308f2cd",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
